  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Caribbean Infrastructure Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As announced by the UK government in September 2015, the UK Caribbean Infrastructure Fund will create critical economic infrastructure including: bridges; renewable energy; ports; water; and sea defences that will increase productivity and resilience to natural disasters and climate change. This fund aims to improve economic development in 8 ODA eligible and 1 ODA eligible Overseas Territory by helping to boost growth and creating jobs across the region.</narrative>
  </description>
